{"text": "My own garden. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Is my own garden. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said the Giant. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I will let nobody play in it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But myself. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So he built a high wall. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> All around it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then he put up a sign. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That said TRESPASSERS WILL BE PROSECUTED. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was a very selfish Giant. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Now the poor children. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Had nowhere to play. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They tried to play. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On the road but it was dusty and stony. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> How happy we were there. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They said to each other. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then the Spring came. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And there were little flowers and birds everywhere. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Only in the garden of the Selfish Giant. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was still winter. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The birds did not sing there. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And the trees forgot to blossom.", "alignment": {"characters": ["M", "y", " ", "o", "w", "n", " ", "g", "a", "r", "d", "e", "n", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "s", " ", "m", "y", " ", "o", "w", "n", " ", "g", "a", "r", "d", "e", "n", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "a", "i", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "G", "i", "a", "n", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", " ", "w", "i", "l", "l", " ", "l", "e", "t", " ", "n", "o", "b", "o", "d", "y", " ", "p", "l", "a", "y", " ", "i", "n", " ", "i", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "B", "u", "t", " ", "m", "y", "s",